{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PweGu1oGtcxyUJheXJo4MU","type":"tool_result","content":".github/workflows/ci.yml:52:      # The scripts below build binaries and fixtures under TMPDIR; this keeps\n.pose/adr/2026-10-25-continue-delegated-runs-under-one-immutable-attempt.md:12:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-02-handoff-agency-readiness-outcome-review.md:30:adversarial and roadmap-findings suites pass in the required external TMPDIR.\n.pose/knowledge/2026-11-04-handoff-pose-b34-implementation.md:85:Para Go nesta máquina, usar o cache padrão e `GOTMPDIR`/`TMPDIR` em\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:295:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:319:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:324:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:350:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:522:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:546:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:551:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/policy/delegation.json:577:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/2026-10-17-pose-test-scripts-temp-cleanup-review.md:15:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/2026-10-17-pose-test-scripts-temp-cleanup-review.md:19:F1/F3/F4/F5/F6 remain resolved in their original scopes: 12 independent permission/failure cases clean up; exact shipped setup markers are reached with exits 0/1/1/1; delivered INT/TERM produce 130/143 and clean up; missing-handler and old-permissions mutations fail; hygiene itself cleans up on signal and failure; composition docs name pose_test_tmp_remove. F7 passes eight helper/real-script cases using relative TMPDIR with CDPATH unset or exported as dot.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-17-pose-test-scripts-temp-cleanup-review.md:23:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/2026-10-17-pose-test-scripts-temp-cleanup-review.md:29:R2: all three real scripts pass with individual absolute TMPDIR and leave it empty; relative/CDPATH variants also pass. Quickstart --binary and install --binary/--previous 6.2.0 run from another directory. The real Docker measurement proves the copied quickstart consumer still executes its assertions with the helper supplied.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-17-pose-test-scripts-temp-cleanup-review.md:35:Residual boundaries: SIGKILL independently leaves a root and cannot run a trap; machine/power loss has the same inherent limitation. Persistent caches and tools ignoring TMPDIR remain outside the declared scope. The static rule reads lines; unusual syntax that defeats the helper requires reviewer inspection of new scripts. These are documented boundaries, not accepted unresolved findings. No corrective follow-up remains.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-18-pose-b28-d7ebc300-independent-review.md:49:- Mutações em TMPDIR normal: 12/12 registradas como killed. O controle adversarial B8 demonstra que o executor também aceita erro de shell como killed; o número isolado não prova a causa.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-18-pose-b28-d7ebc300-independent-review.md:116:- Reprodução/evidência: TMPDIR com espaços gera cd: too many arguments, exit 2 e nenhum go test executado; o script registra killed=1,total=1. Captura observacional de subprocess.run preservou execução real e comprovou o erro.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-18-pose-b28-d7ebc300-independent-review.md:118:- Mesma classe nos consumidores vizinhos/origem: Código novo. Vizinhos b14-mutations.py e b15-mutations.py repetem shell=True e a mesma heurística de duas substrings. Executor nativo validate usa program+args+cwd e falha em exit não-zero. As 12 mutações em TMPDIR normal foram reexecutadas e morreram, mas esse resultado não cobre este controle adversarial.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-18-pose-b28-independent-review.md:47:- 12/12 mutações do implementador reexecutadas em TMPDIR normal; B8 mostra por que esse número sozinho não prova morte por asserção.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-18-pose-b28-independent-review.md:114:- Reprodução/evidência: TMPDIR com espaços gera cd: too many arguments, exit 2 e nenhum go test executado; o script registra killed=1,total=1. Captura observacional de subprocess.run preservou execução real e comprovou o erro.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-18-pose-b28-independent-review.md:116:- Varredura de classe nos vizinhos/origem: Código novo. Vizinhos b14-mutations.py e b15-mutations.py repetem shell=True e a mesma heurística de duas substrings. Executor nativo validate usa program+args+cwd e falha em exit não-zero. As 12 mutações em TMPDIR normal foram reexecutadas e morreram, mas esse resultado não cobre este controle adversarial.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-19-b38r9-independent-review.md:92:recusa a divergência. Com `TMPDIR` apontando para pai ausente ou arquivo:\n.pose/reports/2026-10-19-b38r9-independent-review.md:100:a mesma conversão incorreta por inspeção. Os testes não alteram TMPDIR de outros processos.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-21-b08-implementation.md:57:`TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f`, `GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false` for validation.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-21-ci-security-execution.md:12:- Final collection uses TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f, GOTOOLCHAIN=go1.26.10 and GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false. The latter disables VCS stamping of validation binaries only; all 141 commands still run, including real Git unknown-state and materialization regressions. Release workflow flags are unchanged. Read the canonical .pose/results/delivery-validation.json for the actual final head, results and provenance; only a fresh passing result may be sealed.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b28-pending-closeout.md:7:Tech-debt scan is INCOMPLETE due two existing invalid legacy spec sources; scanned marker is covered, no claim of debt-free completeness. Validation uses Go1.26.10, TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f, GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false only for validation builds.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:48:- Linux `TestUpdatePreviewHasNoPhysicalMutationEvents`: build before watching, then execute the actual CLI binary as a child with usage recording enabled while inotify watches every fixture directory, `.git`, external targets and `TMPDIR`. Reject mutation events including transient staging/locks and verify internal/external dangling targets remain absent. This is a subprocess filesystem-event audit, **not** a syscall audit. Snapshot and operation tests also cover modes, links and contents.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:54:Run from `pose-mcp` with `GOTOOLCHAIN=go1.26.10 TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false`. The VCS flag applies only to validation build stamping. Do not touch unrelated `/tmp/.git` or weaken fixture guards. No new dependencies were installed.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:147:- In the same file, `TestUpdatePreviewReleaseCurrentTreeAndHistoricalTagStaySeparate` checks staged version/policy candidate defects, later-policy tolerance for an immutable tagged cut, staged archived-fragment corruption and strict staged-manifest refusal. The correct worktree cannot replace the cut held by the tag. A valid text-source tag remains readable with nonexistent `TMPDIR`.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:149:- Extend `cli/update_preview_linux_test.go`: the actual compiled CLI's force preview now also reaches an adopted governed release and its committed text-version snapshot. Prepare/tag fixture inputs before installing watches. With usage enabled, inotify watches the instance, `.git`, external link targets and `TMPDIR`, including transient create/remove/lock events. Both plain and force cases pass without mutation. This is a filesystem-event audit, not a syscall audit.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:150:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:154:Run from `pose-mcp` as uid 1000 with `GOTOOLCHAIN=go1.26.10 TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false`. Fixed test time stays 2026-10-22 by design. The validation directory contains logs and binaries, not native governance attestations.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b29-update-preview-implementation.md:174:All logs below are under `/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f/`. Run Go commands from `pose-mcp`, as uid 1000, with `GOTOOLCHAIN=go1.26.10 TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false`.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-22-b30-pending-closeout.md:9:Validation environment: Go1.26.10, TMPDIR=/var/tmp/pose-b07-validation-0bf729f, GOFLAGS=-buildvcs=false. The VCS flag isolates validation fixture builds from unrelated /tmp Git metadata; it does not change release stamping or fail-closed Git guards.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-24-amendment-history-before-close.md:23:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/2026-10-24-amendment-history-before-close.md:29:Race rerun with `TMPDIR=/var/tmp` passed both changed packages (pose 80.285s, CLI 98.065s). The ambient cause is `/tmp/.git`, which the engine's ancestor discovery sees even when fixtures are placed in a child directory; GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES is intentionally stripped by the production git wrapper. Final collection therefore uses `/var/tmp`. Structure check caught a missing `spec:` field in the new changelog fragment; corrected to the canonical template before the final collection.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-24-amendment-history-before-close.md:37:- Final `TMPDIR=/var/tmp pose validate --strict --json-out .pose/results/delivery-validation.json`: PASS 151/151, 178.8s, HEAD `8a351407a57d3b729ff76b9977bba34e3c31e503`, zero failed/errored/skipped. Includes full Go suite, build/vet and registered `amendment-history-before-close-integration`. Earlier failed /tmp collections were not sealed.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-24-b10-implementation.md:16:- `go test ./...`: PASS with isolated `TMPDIR=/tmp/pose-b10-check-tmp` and `GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES` set to the same root. Initial concurrent full run encountered existing Git fixture discovery failures caused by ambient `/tmp/.git`; isolated affected fixtures and full rerun passed, without changing Git engine code.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-24-b11-terminal-verification.md:13:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/2026-10-24-b11-terminal-verification.md:23:Full `TMPDIR=/var/tmp go test ./...`: PASS after the catalogue/link/effect adjustments. `govulncheck ./...`: PASS, no vulnerabilities. Strict spec lint: PASS. Registered global validation, immutable artifact/surface gates and native review remain the authority for closeout.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-25-b16-attempt-ledger.md:33:Full `TMPDIR=/var/tmp go test ./...`: PASS after the runtime-reference and history-only compatibility fixes. Expanded domain/CLI/MCP controls passed, including HTML and legacy identity. Targeted race passed domain/CLI (1.177s/8.811s) on the reservation implementation; final-budget race and canonical validation follow before sealing. Govulncheck found no vulnerabilities. The independent reviewer confirmed the final shared-budget implementation and adversarial probes without open findings.\n.pose/reports/2026-10-28-delegated-conclusions-round4.md:49:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/claude-review-sandbox-qualification.md:49:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/claude-review-sandbox-qualification.md:53:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/reports/doctor-closeout-operation/validation-isolation.json:9:  \"known_setup_defect\": \"TMPDIR nested under Harne8 Git root; fixtures without a .git began using the parent root, demonstrated in CLI amend and usage storage failures. Other failures remain unclassified pending isolated rerun.\",\n.pose/review-attempts/0bb5cb993d1f7d42b4be131a/000001.json:6:  \"scope\": \"spec:pose-review-run-reaps-lingering-reviewer-processes\",\n.pose/review-attempts/24c92f0f02b9cd31fee83a86/000001.json:6:  \"scope\": \"spec:pose-review-run-reaps-lingering-reviewer-process